@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Сложение: 5
POST {{baseUrl}}/add
Content-Type: application/json

{"a":2,"b":3}

### Вычитание: -1
POST {{baseUrl}}/subtract
Content-Type: application/json

{"a":2,"b":3}

### Умножение: 6
POST {{baseUrl}}/multiply
Content-Type: application/json

{"a":2,"b":3}

### Деление: 3.5
POST {{baseUrl}}/divide
Content-Type: application/json

{"a":7,"b":2}

### Операция по символу: 3.5
