Content-Type: application/json

{"a":7,"op":"/","b":2}

### Сложное выражение: 22
POST {{baseUrl}}/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{"expression":"(a+b)*c + (d-e)/(f-g)","variables":{"a":2,"b":3,"c":4,"d":10,"e":4,"f":5,"g":2}}

